<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/target/procedural-constraint> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/lossyDrop> "the projectable fragment is a range-restricted, ∀-guarded integrity condition (guard(this) → φ(this)) whose per-focus condition φ is a Horn / NNF tree of binary atoms, existentials, disjunctions and (path-)universals: it lowers to a SELECT $this WHERE { guard ∧ ¬φ } via BGP + FILTER NOT EXISTS + UNION" .
